From 0e3ddc2821fbf83c240e9c1890529a568d2a66d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:31:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(examples): regenerate the first 4-axis part project under
 stamp v3

PR #2135 saved examples/first-4axis-part.camproj on a branch without
PR #2155, which moved the operation stamp salt to camcraft-op-stamp-v3.
On main each cached operation of the example read stale, the machine
check refused it, and the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program
failed. Regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1: the five stamps and the file
version (62 -> 63) change; the cached moves and the posted program
examples/first-4axis-part.nc are byte-identical.

Fixes #2198

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 examples/first-4axis-part.camproj | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

